+Mirrors parity_replay_2026-09-12/devices/replay_driver.py build_state_from_snapshot (G-P3 forward mode): the float64 state saved at the
+close of anchor S, the cache frozen after anchor A (rows <= A are what the live process held after its own fetch at A), and the ledger
+rows served for (S, A] from the ledger frozen after A."""
