+ema_v0[s] = state after every settlement <= ema[s].last_ts (so the P1 invariant name set / last_ts == v1 holds by construction).
+Rows: pod2 ledger_full.npz (zip U fund_aug API) U both bundle seeds U every frozen producer ledger U the input state's ledger; the same second
+must carry the same rate in every source (conflicts => refuse). Gates (all must pass, else rc 2 and no output):
+  G1 the code under test's ema_v0_problems(ema, ema_v0) == []
+  G2 completeness: an independent v1 rebuild over the same row union with the producer's stored labels reproduces the input state's v1 acc
+     for every name (|d| <= 1e-12) — a missing or extra settlement in the union would break this
+  G3 the input state's ledger rows are all present in the union with equal rate
+Usage: python3 -B p1_build_ema_v0.py --state DIR --code DIR --out DIR"""
+import os, sys, json, time, argparse, importlib.util
