+"""tests_fx_prod.py — FIXPROGRAM 2026-09-13 FX-PROD red/green battery (P1 king col 80, P2 V2MAIN col 80 + neighbours, P6 seed loader).
+Real shapes only: frozen producer snapshots (work/frozen, SHA256SUMS), the in-service bundle and booster (read-only), real anchors, real ledger rows.
+Replay devices are generated from THE CODE UNDER TEST (--code <dir>, default = this file's directory) by the Phase-1 generators (fx/fx_harness.py).
